# Windsurf Rules — wger-tiago

## Stack
- Flutter + Dart
- Riverpod (riverpod_annotation + code generation)
- Clean Architecture: data / domain / presentation layers
- Legacy Provider coexists in lib/providers/ — do not modify it unless explicitly asked

---

## Clean Architecture — folder structure

Every feature lives in lib/features/<feature_name>/ with this exact structure:

```
lib/features/<feature>/
├── index.dart                          # root barrel
├── data/
│   ├── api/
│   │   ├── <feature>_api_service.dart  # raw HTTP only
│   │   └── index.dart
│   └── repositories/
│       ├── <feature>_repository.dart   # implements I<Feature>Repository
│       └── index.dart
├── domain/
│   ├── models/
│   │   └── index.dart                  # re-export from lib/models/ if shared
│   └── repositories/
│       ├── i_<feature>_repository.dart # abstract interface
│       └── index.dart
└── presentation/
    ├── providers/
    │   ├── <feature>_provider.dart
    │   ├── <feature>_provider.g.dart   # generated — never edit manually
    │   └── index.dart
    ├── screens/
    │   └── index.dart
    └── widgets/
        └── index.dart
```

Reference implementation: lib/features/body_weight/

