## Import ordering — ALWAYS sort alphabetically within each section

Dart import sections in order:
1. `dart:` imports
2. `package:flutter/` imports
3. `package:` third-party imports (alphabetical)
4. `package:wger/` imports (alphabetical)
5. Relative imports

```dart
// CORRECT
import 'package:flutter/material.dart';
import 'package:flutter_riverpod/flutter_riverpod.dart';
import 'package:riverpod_annotation/riverpod_annotation.dart';
import 'package:wger/features/trophies/data/api/trophy_api_service.dart';
import 'package:wger/features/trophies/domain/repositories/i_trophy_repository.dart';
import 'package:wger/providers/wger_base_riverpod.dart';

// WRONG — out-of-order package:wger/ imports trigger directives_ordering lint
import 'package:wger/providers/wger_base_riverpod.dart';
import 'package:wger/features/trophies/data/api/trophy_api_service.dart';
```

