## When showing diffs

- Always show diff only unless full file is explicitly requested
- When creating a new file that others must implement or depend on, always show diffs for ALL affected files in the same response — not just the new file
- Example: creating IFeatureRepository → also show FeatureRepository implementing it AND the provider depending on it

