## AsyncValue access patterns

```dart
// Reading in widgets
final state = ref.watch(featureProvider);

// Full handling
state.when(
  data: (value) => ...,
  loading: () => const CircularProgressIndicator(),
  error: (e, _) => Text('Error: $e'),
);

// Nullable access (when loading/error should be silent)
final value = state.valueOrNull;
final value = state.asData?.value;

// WRONG — direct property access on AsyncValue
state.someProperty  // crashes if loading or error
```

